    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 30 June 2017, the 13 th Chamber of the Supreme Administrative Court granted the request ... the court overturned the judgment of the 6th Chamber of the Istanbul Administrative Court dated 19 March 2014 and annulled the sale in question."^^xsd:string .

